{"id": "f003", "query": "Agentic workflow 的三大优势是哪三类？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 3, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库中的信息（见 [Chunk 1]），Agentic workflow 的三大优势是：\n\n1. **性能提升**：GPT-3.5 + agentic workflow 的提升幅度，超过了 GPT-3.5 到 GPT-4 的模型代际提升（有 Human Eval benchmark 性能数据支撑）。\n2. **并行化**：多个 web search/fetch 可同时进行，比人类顺序处理更快。\n3. **模块化**：组件可独立替换（例如更换搜索引擎或更换模型），不同的步骤甚至可以使用不同的 LLM。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 3, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.17, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.06, "pipeline_latency_s": 7.2, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 5.03, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 17.45, "error": null}
{"id": "f004", "query": "多模态 Reflection 的例子是什么，为什么 reflection 步骤可能换 reasoning model？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库内容，回答如下：\n\n* **多模态 Reflection 的例子：**\n  让多模态 LLM “看”自己生成的图表图片，并利用视觉推理进行改进。具体案例是：**将堆叠条形图（stacked bar graph）改进/调整为分组条形图（grouped bar graph）**。\n\n* **为什么 Reflection 步骤可能换 reasoning model：**\n  知识库指出，在模型选择上，**初稿生成使用通用模型，而 reflection（反思）步骤使用 reasoning model（推理模型）的效果可能更好**。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.98, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 7.43, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 4.59, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 18.03, "error": null}
