{"id": "f006", "query": "Invoice processing 的 error analysis 为什么最后该优化 LLM prompt，而不是 PDF 转文本？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "hard", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库中的真实案例数据，在 Invoice processing（发票处理）中，对“PDF转文本”与“LLM提取错误”的占比进行分析后发现：\n\n**LLM提取错误占了大多数**。\n\n因此，应该针对占大多数错误的组件优化 LLM prompt，而不是去优化 PDF 转文本组件，这样可以避免在非核心问题上白白浪费几个月的时间。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 2, "contains_pass": false, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 6.16, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 6.66, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 4.98, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 17.83, "error": null}
{"id": "f007", "query": "Planning with Code Execution 的 sunglasses store lab 验证了什么？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库中的信息（Chunk 1），在 **Planning with Code Execution** 的 **sunglasses store** 场景 Lab 中，验证了：\n\n**LLM 能够自主生成“正则解析意图 + TinyDB 查询 + 交易记录写入”的完整代码，而开发者只需提供沙箱执行环境。** \n\n这展示了让 LLM 直接编写代码作为计划本身（而非调用预定义工具链）的可行性。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 6.18, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.04, "pipeline_latency_s": 6.68, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 5.95, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 18.85, "error": null}
{"id": "f008", "query": "MCP 为什么说 LangGraph 和 MCP 互补不互斥？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库内容（特别是 [Chunk 1]），MCP 与 LangGraph 互补不互斥的原因如下：\n\n1. **官方定位不取代**：官方口径明确表示 MCP 并不会取代 LangGraph 等 Agent 框架。\n2. **两层正交，职责分工不同**：\n   * **LangGraph 负责 Agent Loop 编排**：其框架价值在于 Agent Loop 本身，包括编排、知识管理、上下文压缩以及响应工具结果。\n   * **MCP 负责工具与上下文的标准化接入**：MCP 仅仅标准化“把工具/context 接进来”这一层。\n   * 整体架构表现为：**LangGraph 管 loop 编排 + MCP 管工具供给**。\n3. **官方适配支持**：LangGraph 已经提供了官方的 MCP adapter（适配器），便于两者结合使用。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.63, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 7.99, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 4.0, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 17.65, "error": null}
{"id": "f009", "query": "MCP 工具规模超过 50-100 个时，笔记列了哪三种解决方案？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "hard", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 4, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据笔记内容，当 MCP 工具规模超过 50-100 个时，提供了以下三种超规模解决方案：\n\n1. **tool-to-search-tools**：对工具库进行 RAG 或关键词搜索，采取“先检索再暴露”的机制。\n2. **层级/渐进暴露**：将工具进行分组，并按照任务逐一解锁。\n3. **task-scoped**：按照具体的 agent 角色或任务来裁剪工具集（Action Space）。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 4, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.89, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 7.05, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 5.34, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 18.31, "error": null}
{"id": "f010", "query": "并行 tool call 消息配对 bug 的修复本质是什么？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "hard", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库内容，并行 tool call 消息配对 bug 的修复本质如下：\n\n**将处理粒度从“逐块”改为“逐轮”**：\n1. **先收集**整条回复中的**全部 `tool_use` 块**。\n2. **逐个执行**这些工具调用。\n3. 将执行结果**打包成一条 `user` 消息**（其中包含多个 `tool_result` 块）整体回传。\n4. 最后再发起下一轮请求。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.4, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 9.01, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 3.11, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 17.54, "error": null}
