{"id": "f012", "query": "Vibe 课程里事后理解 Pattern 的双重价值是什么？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库内容（Chunk 1），Vibe 课程中“事后理解 Pattern”的双重价值为：\n\n1. **是学习法**：借机搞懂不懂的层面（例如对不懂的名词/框架进行追问，达到项目级和概念级的理解）。\n2. **是校验手段**：确认 agent 的实现和你的心智模型一致，同时能够发现死代码（例如捞出代码中残留的旧 inside-memory 实现等可清理的旧代码）。", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.59, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 6.84, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 5.79, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 18.26, "error": null}
{"id": "f013", "query": "Vibe coding 前为什么要先做可行性预判？", "category": "factual", "difficulty": "medium", "expected_route": "rag", "actual_route": "rag", "route_correct": true, "is_boundary": false, "retrieval_hit": true, "retrieval_keyword_hits": 5, "relevance_ok": true, "answer": "根据知识库内容，Vibe coding 前先做可行性预判（在构建前先想“这事技术上通不通”）的原因是：\n\n**为了确认核心数据或能力是可获取的，从而避免让 agent 去追求一个在技术上不可行的目标。**\n\n*例如：Matt 敢直接用一句话让 agent 制作 SEO analyzer，是因为他事先确认了 meta tags 嵌入在 HTML 中且任何人都能抓取。*", "answer_scope": "eval_simplified", "delivery_kind": null, "contains_hits": 5, "contains_pass": true, "grounded": true, "verification_status": null, "faithfulness": null, "answer_relevancy": null, "source_disclosed": null, "router_latency_s": 5.86, "diagnostic_retrieval_latency_s": 0.03, "pipeline_latency_s": 6.15, "posthoc_groundedness_latency_s": 6.17, "judge_latency_s": 0.0, "llm_call_count": 3, "llm_retry_count": 0, "llm_retry_sleep_s": 0.0, "latency_s": 18.2, "error": null}
